Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:00:02.39,0:00:05.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Robin is in that\Nbuilding behind you, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:06.89,0:00:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta my way, bull guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:08.82,0:00:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:10.71,0:00:14.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you haven't realized this\Nbut what you are doing right now
Dialogue: 50,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is nothing short of\Na world-class crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.79,0:02:46.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So then, when Sodom\Nand his brother Gomorrah
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.23,0:02:50.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were about to die in the belly of a Sea\NKing, the Franky Family showed up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.63,0:02:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were rescued and told these\Nfateful words that he still remembers:
Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.20,0:02:57.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Look, we're already full\Nso we're not gonna eat you!"
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And from that day forward,\Nthe two brothers swore
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.71,0:03:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,their undying loyalty\Nto their savior, Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.02,0:03:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Franky Family brought\Ndown a Sea King, ate it,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.82,0:03:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they just happened to be saved\Nbecause Franky was already full?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.89,0:03:14.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.73,0:03:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.43,0:03:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.64,0:03:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mind watching where you're going?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.78,0:03:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.11,0:03:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"I will follow Big Bro Franky\Nuntil the day I die!" he says.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.85,0:03:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet he's really happy that one\Nof us can understand what he's saying.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.19,0:03:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said "By the way, the masked guy
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.33,0:03:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that was with you never\Nmade it on board my back.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.40,0:03:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?"
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's talking about Sniper King!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.77,0:03:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why now? Why now?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.09,0:03:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did he fall off?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.12,0:03:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He hasn't been here from the start!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.06,0:04:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.09,0:04:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did he run away again?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arrogant pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.46,0:04:16.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't keep this\Nfoolishness up forever!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.81,0:04:19.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you wanna pass, you'll have\Nto go through me to do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.66,0:04:21.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine then!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.52,0:04:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.96,0:04:29.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that really the best you've got?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.33,0:04:31.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battleship Cannon!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's only three of them!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.95,0:04:45.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you're good at\Nfighting, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.65,0:04:49.49,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Then you can beat those guys, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.49,0:04:50.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.24,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get her back.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.24,0:04:59.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We just needed motivation.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.04,0:05:03.58,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that we know Robin needs saving,\Nthere's no limit to what Luffy
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.58,0:05:06.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,and the rest of our\Ncrew can accomplish!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.47,0:05:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I believe in him.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.97,0:05:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.77,0:05:11.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.47,0:05:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get that rope guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.94,0:05:16.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not gonna happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.39,0:05:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shrouds and Ratline Knot!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.06,0:05:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.21,0:05:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Consider this a dead end.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.06,0:05:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up and go.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.04,0:05:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just get to the point already.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.44,0:05:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The power of the World\NGovernment stretches across
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.54,0:05:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,more than one hundred\Nand seventy nations.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.75,0:05:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This island is a symbol\Nof our strength and resolve.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.25,0:05:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attacking it is not simply\Nan act of rebellion,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.35,0:05:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but a declaration of war against\Nevery country in our alliance.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.76,0:05:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are bound by our\Nhonor to strike you down.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.97,0:06:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not only\Nface a merciless death,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.44,0:06:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but serve as an example\Nto the entire world.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.44,0:06:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're, at most, a few dozen men.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.87,0:06:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should have thought\Nthis out more carefully.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.53,0:06:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said "outta my way."
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.90,0:06:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you gonna move, or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I move or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.54,0:06:17.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The point is that\Nyou condemned yourself
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.78,0:06:21.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to a death sentence the second\Nyou set foot on Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.45,0:06:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You understand that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.88,0:06:24.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fighting is a waste of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.65,0:06:27.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got a taste of our\Nstrength at Iceberg's mansion.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.80,0:06:31.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot defeat our Six Powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.10,0:06:33.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The difference between\Nus is simply too great.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.84,0:06:38.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe that's true.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.64,0:06:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But y'know, for some reason, I have\Na feeling I'm gonna win this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.54,0:06:48.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.54,0:06:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.85,0:06:52.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Rifle!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.73,0:07:05.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.87,0:07:08.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He wasn't like this at all\Nwhen I fought him before!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.84,0:07:11.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,How is it that he's so\Nmuch stronger now?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.89,0:07:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care about your honor,\Nor your Government, or any of that.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.56,0:07:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You do what you want with that crap.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.95,0:07:57.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that matters is\Ngetting Robin outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.89,0:08:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.46,0:08:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.57,0:08:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we wanted to, it's not like\Nwe could go back and pick him up.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll figure out\Nsomething or other.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.24,0:08:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But the whole island\Nis swarming with Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.95,0:08:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's not Luffy, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.42,0:08:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can't fight them off on his own!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.26,0:08:29.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we don't realize it at first,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.46,0:08:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we've gotten stronger with\Nevery challenge we've faced.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.46,0:08:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may not think he's tough,\Nbut he's survived as well as anyone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.60,0:08:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one from our crew would\Ndie at a time like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.04,0:08:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.87,0:08:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! We're almost to the courthouse!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.90,0:08:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This oughta stop 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.38,0:09:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've been hit! No!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.05,0:09:03.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We finally got one!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.12,0:09:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sodom!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.27,0:09:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. This is bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.18,0:09:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He needs my help!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.61,0:09:16.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grit those teeth and hold on, Sodom!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.86,0:09:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't fall yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.83,0:09:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys, you're gonna have to jump!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get off him, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.49,0:09:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sodom can't go on!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That mortar hit him\Nsquare in the chest!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.43,0:09:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's about to go down!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.39,0:09:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep moving no matter what!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the only ones who can do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.64,0:09:50.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He says "go!"
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.26,0:10:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's coming down!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody's riding it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.41,0:10:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd they go?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.61,0:10:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.01,0:10:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.96,0:10:44.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd I have to not\Nland on that King Bull?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.74,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.74,0:10:48.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm way behind everyone else now.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.01,0:10:54.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}These shipwrights are awesome,\Nbut I should probably catch up with the others.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.78,0:10:58.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Then again, I did\Nleave the crew, didn't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.02,0:10:59.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just run away.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, running is the\Nlast thing I should do!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.56,0:11:12.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whether\NI'm a part of the crew or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.26,0:11:14.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I put on this disguise so\NI could help my friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.47,0:11:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If Robin is willing to sacrifice herself\Nto save us, it's the least I can do!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.27,0:11:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My manhood is on the line, here!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.82,0:11:25.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, there's only one way to get\Nback to the others at this point.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I call it "Operation Disguise Myself
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.46,0:11:30.01,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,as One of the Government\NAgents and Walk Straight
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.01,0:11:32.54,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,to the Courthouse\NWithout Anyone Noticing."
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.54,0:11:34.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.07,0:11:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack! Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.41,0:11:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're flooding the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.44,0:11:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna sink!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.63,0:11:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.73,0:11:53.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The giant woke up!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.90,0:11:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We tried for 50 years and blew it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We let our bosses down!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.57,0:12:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean the government?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.94,0:12:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're a disgrace to\Nall the giants in Elbaf!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.03,0:12:12.54,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbaf. Giants? Bosses? Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.54,0:12:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're from Elbaf?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.27,0:12:17.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like, the Warrior's Village, Elbaf?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.31,0:12:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you, runt?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.18,0:12:22.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Sniper King from Sniper Island.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.38,0:12:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm interested in your story,\Nby all means, continue!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.78,0:12:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's not much point in telling\Nyou, but I guess it can't hurt.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.79,0:12:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashii and I used to\Nbe pirates 100 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.92,0:12:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our crew traveled the whole world.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.29,0:12:44.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But everything changed when\Nwe visited a certain island.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.59,0:12:49.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since they couldn't come to an agreement,\Nour two bosses started a duel.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.19,0:12:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We had to split up the crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.35,0:12:52.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were at a loss.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.85,0:12:55.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we could do was go\Nback to our hometowns.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.77,0:12:58.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A warrior's battle is\Nlife-or-death but as soon as
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.74,0:13:01.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's over the winner is supposed\Nto come back to their village.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.91,0:13:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We waited for fifty years and\Nnever heard from either of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.75,0:13:07.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something was wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.48,0:13:10.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Kashii and I set out to\Nsea to go back to the island
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.96,0:13:12.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and find out what\Nhappened with the duel.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.33,0:13:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But on our way there, we got\Ncaptured by some Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.97,0:13:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They forced us to answer
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all kinds of questions about our crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.74,0:13:21.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we found out the truth.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.01,0:13:26.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Even though our bosses were strong fighters,\Nthey got caught by Marines just like us
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.35,0:13:28.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and were stuck in\Nsome big government jail!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.86,0:13:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.89,0:13:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of that stuff happened\Nabout 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government made a deal with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.05,0:13:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They said if we would work for them for\N100 years, they'd set our bosses free.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.40,0:13:44.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All we had to do was protect\Nthis gate from intruders.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.08,0:13:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As long as we didn't let anyone through,\Nwhen our time was up, our bosses
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.13,0:13:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and us could all go\Nback to Elbaf together.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.14,0:13:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since giants live to be 300 or so,\Nwe didn't think it was so bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.21,0:13:59.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we agreed to the deal and kept\Nour end of the bargain for 50 years.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.34,0:14:02.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But then those pirates came through\Nthe gate and ruined everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.69,0:14:04.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm so ashamed!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.39,0:14:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm crying!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.68,0:14:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.21,0:14:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now our bosses are gonna be stuck in that\Ndumb prison for the rest of their lives!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on, wait a second.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.27,0:14:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nfunny about that story.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.97,0:14:18.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think this is funny,\Nyou little jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.14,0:14:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you laugh at our pride?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.54,0:14:22.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't mean like funny "ha ha."
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean funny "weird."
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what's so weird about it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.41,0:14:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before we came here, my crew\Nmet those bosses of yours.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.01,0:14:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we saw them fighting their duel!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.25,0:14:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their names are\NDorry and Broggy, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.31,0:14:38.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The warriors from Elbaf.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.07,0:14:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fighting in an evenly-matched duel,\Nover and over again, for 100 years!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.35,0:14:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.62,0:14:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you know their names?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.49,0:14:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must be lying.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.22,0:14:55.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you need more proof than that,\NI can tell you anything you want!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.09,0:15:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.34,0:15:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still don't believe me?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.07,0:15:19.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.82,0:15:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their weapons, maybe?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.91,0:15:30.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How they fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.82,0:15:34.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Seventy-three thousand, four\Nhundred and sixty-six duels.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know everything about them!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.72,0:15:39.56,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Seventy-three thousand, four\Nhundred and sixty six draws.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.56,0:15:41.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We really met them.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.13,0:15:42.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.37,0:15:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They weren't captured 50 years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.74,0:15:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's nothing but a big fat lie!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.27,0:16:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, aim carefully!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.77,0:16:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get it in your sights, men!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.91,0:16:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a trench mortar. Gomorrah! Dodge!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.85,0:16:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn bastards had an\Nambush waiting for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.15,0:16:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Taking the main road\Nsure was a bad idea!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.55,0:16:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn around, quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.13,0:16:44.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.16,0:16:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Sodom.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.77,0:16:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.15,0:17:07.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.47,0:17:10.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Who could be calling?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes? Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.21,0:17:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Howdy howdy!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.61,0:17:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Granny Kokoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.74,0:17:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.08,0:17:20.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, sounds\Nlike you're still alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.41,0:17:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a little something\NI forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.97,0:17:25.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure you're busy,\Nso I'll make it quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.68,0:17:26.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.88,0:17:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you remember that map Paulie drew,\Nyou might notice there's no path
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.15,0:17:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the courthouse to\Nthe Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.52,0:17:35.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's been bothering me but\NI was afraid to ask about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.84,0:17:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at the courthouse.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see those towers on either side?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.49,0:17:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see them.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.49,0:17:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, now there's a lever on\Nthe top floor of each of those towers.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.23,0:17:47.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you folks can get in\Nthere and pull both of 'em,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.27,0:17:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a drawbridge'll come down from the\Ncourthouse to the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.08,0:17:52.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.18,0:17:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how do you know\Nabout all that stuff, Granny?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.19,0:17:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I came here with Tom\Nages ago to fix that bridge.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.76,0:18:00.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn stupid ungrateful Government!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.97,0:18:03.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chimney wants to talk, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.87,0:18:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirate lady.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.76,0:18:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me? Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.14,0:18:09.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've got you loud and clear!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.11,0:18:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just saw your rubber pirate buddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.13,0:18:15.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was over on the rooftop\Nof the courthouse just now!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.18,0:18:17.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meow! Meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's where he is!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.40,0:18:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was a bunch of smoke\Nand broken stuff up there too,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.01,0:18:24.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so it looks like\Nhe's wrecking the place!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.14,0:18:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hopefully we'll get there soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.91,0:18:30.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And by the way, don't\Nhang up the transponder snail.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.82,0:18:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like to keep track of\Nwhat's goin' on with you folks.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.39,0:18:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem. See ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.07,0:18:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't keep the captain\Nwaiting. Right, men?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.66,0:18:40.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero! Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.93,0:18:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.83,0:18:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You head straight for the courthouse.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sooner that your crew can\Nget back together, the better.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.72,0:18:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what I say.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.02,0:18:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.82,0:18:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, we'll split in two groups\Nand bring down the drawbridge.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.96,0:19:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Gomorrah?\NTo the courthouse!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.74,0:19:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.71,0:19:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn. Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.20,0:19:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get too cocky, scumbags.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.81,0:19:45.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! The second one's down, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.65,0:19:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's that, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not so fast now, are ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody, move in!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.22,0:19:53.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attention, all Marine guards.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.76,0:19:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here at Block D in\Nthe southeast quadrant,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.64,0:19:59.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the pirate's King Bull\Nhas been eliminated!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All units should move in immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.80,0:20:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Form a blockade around the entire area.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.10,0:20:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I repeat!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.10,0:20:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All military personnel\Nsurround Block D now!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.92,0:20:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems that the jurymen have\Ndelivered the verdict for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.70,0:20:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's guilty as usual, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.45,0:20:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say something, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.48,0:20:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.25,0:20:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On our way!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.78,0:20:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The marines we trampled over\Nare catching up to us again.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.56,0:20:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.26,0:20:31.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's not just them.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.80,0:20:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're surrounded here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.37,0:20:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got trench\Nmortars aimed at us, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.84,0:20:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be like a million\Nbajillion of those guys out there!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.17,0:20:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't even run away anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.38,0:20:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.78,0:20:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Damn, you got it good.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.45,0:20:53.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not everyone gets\Ntheir own rescue squad.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.82,0:20:55.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, just sayin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.09,0:20:58.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm bitter 'cause\Nmy men aren't coming to save me.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.22,0:21:00.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got better stuff to do, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.31,0:21:19.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.51,0:21:21.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.05,0:21:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before you leave, you\Nshould take these with you.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.06,0:21:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are Devil Fruits, aren't they?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.28,0:21:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.01,0:21:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.87,0:21:42.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a surprise!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.15,0:21:44.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapapa.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.38,0:21:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one in person before!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.22,0:21:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's my first time as well!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.09,0:21:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let those things near me!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.56,0:21:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ate one, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.51,0:21:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the fuss?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.54,0:21:56.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:56.28,0:21:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.40,0:22:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The reason they're called "Devil Fruits"\Nis because the people who eat them
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.57,0:22:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,have a little devil living\Ninside their bodies!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.22,0:22:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just think.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.14,0:22:07.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I get too close to one of those things,\Nthe devil inside me might pop out
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.78,0:22:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and start fighting with\Nthe devil inside the fruit.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.13,0:22:13.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If something like that happens,\Nmy whole body'll be blown to bits!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.93,0:22:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's nonsense.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.17,0:22:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a member of an intelligence\Nagency and you believe that?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.97,0:22:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The condition for the\Ntransfer of devil fruit powers
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.84,0:22:29.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has been confirmed by scientists on\Nthe Grand Line for quite some time.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.77,0:22:34.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}The condition you're talking about only\Nhappens when someone eats two Devil Fruits.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.38,0:22:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if devils are involved,\Nbut their bodies do burst apart.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.91,0:22:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The price for greed.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.17,0:22:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What fools.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.41,0:22:43.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you think about the risk that\Ncomes with eating one fruit,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.26,0:22:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can only imagine\Nwhat kind of disaster
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.30,0:22:48.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you might bring upon\Nyourself by eating two of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.90,0:22:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.53,0:22:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's how it works. Still.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.49,0:22:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.36,0:22:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you got two of these.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.16,0:22:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive, Chief.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you pull that one?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.19,0:23:00.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I have connections.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.16,0:23:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.08,0:23:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, best of luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.79,0:23:05.90,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, CP9!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.90,0:23:08.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Grow stronger and stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.49,0:23:11.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,As always, there is\Na certain risk involved.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.07,0:23:14.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't know what kind of\Ndevils reside in those fruits.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.21,0:23:17.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a fruit like\Nthis in any reference book.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.22,0:23:21.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can feel a strange power coming\Nfrom them, a heaviness in the air.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.45,0:23:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's like they're\Nfrom a different world.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.42,0:23:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what everyone says.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.09,0:23:30.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I've been told that you only learn the name\Nof the fruit once you absorb its powers
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.19,0:23:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but there's no guessing what\Nkind of ability you'll gain.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.12,0:23:36.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no denying\Nthat there's a risk involved.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.16,0:23:38.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wrong power could ruin your life.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.06,0:23:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And either way, you'll\Nno longer be able to swim.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.40,0:23:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not an issue of what power\Nyou get, but how you use it.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.19,0:23:47.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what, you won't get weaker.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.46,0:23:50.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And as for being unable to\Nswim, it's hardly a problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.95,0:23:52.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a rare treasure.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.05,0:23:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of the thousands who search for them,\NI'm sure most end up empty-handed
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.03,0:23:58.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or dead by the end of their journey.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.64,0:23:59.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just try it already.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.66,0:24:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.46,0:24:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it. Are you crazy?\NThat thing's evil!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:05.80,0:24:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, they taste like crap, I tell you.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.67,0:24:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.60,0:24:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah right. He's jealous.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.47,0:24:13.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want them\Ngetting stronger! Chapapa.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.11,0:24:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shame.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.84,0:24:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should know, Jabra, that envy
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.65,0:24:21.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and resentment are a man's downfall!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.96,0:24:23.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.74,0:24:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.66,0:24:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon. Just stop.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.86,0:24:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think about this!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.23,0:24:31.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you sell these things,\Nyou could make millions.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.78,0:24:34.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But one bite and you'll be\Ncursed for the rest of your life!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.32,0:24:42.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapapa.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.26,0:24:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.96,0:24:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interesting all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.66,0:24:47.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.60,0:24:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hope it's good.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.37,0:24:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They ate them!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.34,0:24:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.96,0:24:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapapa.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.10,0:25:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.20,0:25:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.27,0:25:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is your body besieged with\Na strange metamorphosis?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.10,0:25:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapapa!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.65,0:25:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.18,0:25:23.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say so sooner!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.25,0:25:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's really gross.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.32,0:25:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we got that!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.32,0:25:26.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chapapa!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.39,0:25:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, you ate the\Nwhole thing without a word!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.14,0:25:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well? C'mon!\NTry doing something already.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.84,0:25:35.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna see what kind\Nof powers you got!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.57,0:25:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't feel as if\Nanything is different.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.60,0:25:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll understand\Nthe extent of your changes.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.11,0:25:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The birth of new Devil Fruit\Nusers is always exciting.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.03,0:25:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enjoy yourselves, but I'd try to\Nget those powers under control,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.33,0:25:52.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,while you still can.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.45,0:25:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Depending on our orders,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.27,0:25:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you might have to use\Nthem in real combat soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.41,0:25:59.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems Blueno couldn't wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.88,0:26:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll have to see if\Nhe saves any fun for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.74,0:26:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.44,0:26:15.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.75,0:26:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.68,0:26:22.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oimo and Kashii are back on their feet!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.88,0:26:24.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.05,0:26:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have the strength to\Nfight these guys a second time.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.96,0:26:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were so close!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.76,0:26:39.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crush those criminals into the ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.93,0:26:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grind their little bones\Nbetween your toes, giants!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.93,0:26:53.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.90,0:26:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.24,0:27:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lie to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.92,0:27:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.55,0:27:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they betrayed us!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.02,0:27:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, with our bosses safe, before\Nwe mourn all those years we wasted...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.36,0:27:23.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going let out every\Nlast ounce of our anger on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.20,0:27:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, King of the snipers?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.44,0:27:35.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us not waste words.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.31,0:27:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hoist the signal for the counterattack!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.68,0:27:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon we shall be\Nreunited with our comrades!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.03,0:27:54.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not bad.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.04,0:27:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not bad?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.30,0:28:00.54,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I never thought he'd be able to\Nkeep up with the speed of Shave.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.54,0:28:02.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have to watch that.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.11,0:28:05.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,And since he's made of rubber,\Ndirect attacks won't work.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.58,0:28:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum... \NTempest Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.89,0:28:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.93,0:28:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wheel!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.64,0:28:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Door-Door!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.78,0:28:40.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that a door on the ground?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.81,0:28:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Door-Door.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.57,0:28:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.32,0:28:48.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now there's a bunch of little\Nones all over the place, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.33,0:28:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I can't move!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.96,0:28:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sucks. It's a stupid trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.30,0:28:55.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one doing this?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.90,0:28:57.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how? A Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.94,0:29:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Door-Door Fruit, naturally.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.42,0:29:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I turn all that I touch into doors.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:07.79,0:29:09.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Revolving Door.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.53,0:29:13.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.46,0:29:16.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not moving anywhere\Nbut I'm spinning!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.64,0:29:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno which way is the front!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.20,0:29:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make it stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.74,0:29:22.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.87,0:29:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cook. See that?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.34,0:29:34.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I saw.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.51,0:29:35.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.68,0:29:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's already fighting CP9.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.81,0:29:38.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.78,0:29:39.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.68,0:29:40.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.38,0:29:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.21,0:29:42.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.91,0:29:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing we can do!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.25,0:29:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're totally surrounded.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.52,0:29:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And after taking that last big hit,\NI don't think Gomorrah's going anywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.46,0:29:52.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone open fire and\Nshoot those pirates down
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.73,0:29:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the monster\Nbefore it gets back up!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.44,0:29:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look. We gotta run.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.24,0:30:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't wait here any longer.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.47,0:30:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.34,0:30:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's cut through to the courthouse.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.78,0:30:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's our only option.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.91,0:30:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right! Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.03,0:30:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.63,0:30:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.88,0:30:15.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait. Nobody get off!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.52,0:30:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.76,0:30:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold on tight!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.32,0:30:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That... That's what Gomorrah says!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:43.92,0:30:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's still alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.12,0:30:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The monster's getting back up!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.79,0:30:47.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.83,0:30:49.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it with the trench mortars!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.16,0:30:51.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take that thing down!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.23,0:30:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Return fire! C'mon. Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.61,0:31:02.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Gomorrah! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring down every last one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep firing! Send those marines packing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.20,0:07:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gatling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!
